Did you get everything you need? This mission will be dangerous.
Much of the dimensional fabric has been restored. But this rift has become the portal to the Shadow Dimension.

The Shadow Dimension was believed to be a myth. It was described as a parallel universe that coexists with our world in space-time, but in another dimension.

We need information. Take this C-stone and install it to gather the data we need. Be careful!

[Challenge Objective]

Explore the Shadow Road and install the C-stone in the right place. When you are done, talk to the Royal Shaman again.
